<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>By-Laws - <%= company.name %>
    </title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif;
            padding: 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .clause {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .bold {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>BY-LAW NO. 1</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center;">A by-law relating generally to the transaction of the business and affairs of</p>
    <h2>
        <%= company.name %>
    </h2>
    <p style="text-align: center;">(hereinafter referred to as the "Corporation")</p>

    <div class="section">
        <p class="bold">BE IT ENACTED</p>
        <p>as a by-law of the Corporation as follows:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">1. REGISTERED OFFICE</div>
        <div class="clause">
            The registered office of the Corporation shall be located in the Province of <%=
                company.registeredOfficeAddress.province %>, at <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.street %>, <%=
                        company.registeredOfficeAddress.city %>, <%= company.registeredOfficeAddress.postalCode %>, and
                            the Corporation may from time to time by resolution of the directors change the location of
                            the registered office within the province.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">2. DIRECTORS</div>
        <div class="clause">
            The affairs of the Corporation shall be managed by a board of directors. The initial directors of the
            Corporation shall be those persons whose names are set out in the Articles of Incorporation. Currently,
            there are <%= company.directors.length %> appointed directors.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="bold">3. SHAREHOLDERS</div>
        <div class="clause">
            Meetings of shareholders shall be held at the registered office of the Corporation or at such other place as
            the directors may from time to time determine. The fiscal year end of the Corporation shall be <%=
                company.fiscalYearEnd || 'December 31' %>.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
        <p>ENACTED by the directors of the Corporation this <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %>.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 40px;">_____________________________________</p>
        <p>President / Director</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>